{"id":"3bf8d9271e6214d4","group":"88","path":"88/88-thm-first-incompleteness.md","title":"First Incompleteness Theorem","display":"thm-first-incompleteness — First Incompleteness Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-thm-first-incompleteness","aliases":["88-thm-first-incompleteness"],"display":"thm-first-incompleteness — First Incompleteness Theorem","depends_on":["[[./88-df-peano-arithmetic]]","[[88-df-consistent]]","[[88-df-godel-sentence]]","[[88-df-provable]]","[[88-df-inference-rule]]","[[88-df-incompleteness-theorems]]","[[88-df-ce-set]]","[[88-df-godel-numbering]]","[[88-df-classical-calculus]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-thm-first-incompleteness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-thm-first-incompleteness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-first-incompleteness — First Incompleteness Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"111244cddc854123\" href=\"?note=111244cddc854123\" title=\"./88-df-peano-arithmetic\">88-df-peano-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b3bba05b63c0ebbf\" href=\"?note=b3bba05b63c0ebbf\" title=\"88-df-consistent\">88-df-consistent</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9e711ddb72efdf50\" href=\"?note=9e711ddb72efdf50\" title=\"88-df-godel-sentence\">88-df-godel-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b7bcf1e41c4a9fc9\" href=\"?note=b7bcf1e41c4a9fc9\" title=\"88-df-provable\">88-df-provable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c7ab6c8e893872fb\" href=\"?note=c7ab6c8e893872fb\" title=\"88-df-inference-rule\">88-df-inference-rule</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"75bb18f474452a05\" href=\"?note=75bb18f474452a05\" title=\"88-df-incompleteness-theorems\">88-df-incompleteness-theorems</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b283fc95a9b1376d\" href=\"?note=b283fc95a9b1376d\" title=\"88-df-ce-set\">88-df-ce-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"56061e16f3fb8bfd\" href=\"?note=56061e16f3fb8bfd\" title=\"88-df-godel-numbering\">88-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"0aa80b611d62ec1b\" href=\"?note=0aa80b611d62ec1b\" title=\"88-df-classical-calculus\">88-df-classical-calculus</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (candidate theory containing PA, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"111244cddc854123\" href=\"?note=111244cddc854123\" title=\"./88-df-peano-arithmetic\">88-df-peano-arithmetic</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}\">\\(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\)</span> (arithmetic signature)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> (Peano arithmetic axiom set)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g,R\">\\(g,R\\)</span> (Gödel coding and proof calculus)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Godel}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(g)\">\\(\\mathrm{Godel}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(g)\\)</span> (Gödel-numbering predicate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CE}(g[T])\">\\(\\mathrm{CE}(g[T])\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EffRule}_{S,g}(R)\">\\(\\mathrm{EffRule}_{S,g}(R)\\)</span> (effectivity assumptions)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_R(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_R(T)\\)</span> (consistency, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"b3bba05b63c0ebbf\" href=\"?note=b3bba05b63c0ebbf\" title=\"88-df-consistent\">88-df-consistent</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Incomplete}_R(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Incomplete}_R(T)\\)</span> (syntactic incompleteness)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClassicalCalc}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(R)\">\\(\\mathrm{ClassicalCalc}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(R)\\)</span> 的公理与规则包含条件见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"0aa80b611d62ec1b\" href=\"?note=0aa80b611d62ec1b\" title=\"88-df-classical-calculus\">88-df-classical-calculus</a>；仅有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rule}\">\\(\\mathrm{Rule}\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EffRule}\">\\(\\mathrm{EffRule}\\)</span> 并不提供这些逻辑规则。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}first\\text{-}incompleteness}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\Bigl(&amp;\\mathrm{Theory}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(T)\n\\land\\mathrm{PA}\\subseteq T\n\\land\\mathrm{Godel}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(g)\n\\land\\mathrm{ClassicalCalc}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(R)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{EffRule}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}},g}(R)\n\\land\\mathrm{CE}(g[T])\n\\land\\mathrm{Con}_R(T)\\Bigr)\n\\to\\mathrm{Incomplete}_R(T).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}first\\text{-}incompleteness}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\Bigl(&amp;\\mathrm{Theory}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(T)\n\\land\\mathrm{PA}\\subseteq T\n\\land\\mathrm{Godel}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(g)\n\\land\\mathrm{ClassicalCalc}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(R)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{EffRule}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}},g}(R)\n\\land\\mathrm{CE}(g[T])\n\\land\\mathrm{Con}_R(T)\\Bigr)\n\\to\\mathrm{Incomplete}_R(T).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_R(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_R(T)\\)</span> : 相对于<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>的一致性 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"b3bba05b63c0ebbf\" href=\"?note=b3bba05b63c0ebbf\" title=\"88-df-consistent\">88-df-consistent</a>)</li>\n<li>这是 Rosser 加强后的存在性结论：某个句子两侧均不可证。</li>\n<li>指定 Gödel 句的更细结论及其<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-一致性条件见\n<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"ceae3257aec622e2\" href=\"?note=ceae3257aec622e2\" title=\"88-cor-godel-independent\">88-cor-godel-independent</a>，避免把两种版本混写。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"./88-df-peano-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"111244cddc854123","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[./88-df-peano-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-consistent","status":"resolved","id":"b3bba05b63c0ebbf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-consistent]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-godel-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"9e711ddb72efdf50","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-godel-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-provable","status":"resolved","id":"b7bcf1e41c4a9fc9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-provable]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-inference-rule","status":"resolved","id":"c7ab6c8e893872fb","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-inference-rule]]","embed":false},{"target":"8